{"candidates":[],"candidates_truncated":false,"canonical_status":"canonical","citations":[],"contract_version":"2","descriptions":[{"evidence_id":"danbooru-complete-a26a3829dd42:a26a3829dd42155848392c0636daebd6ca01acf540d3509fec2ac3219f8596c5:line:16672","original":"A character from the [[fate (series)|Fate series]]. Master of [[Archer (fate)|]] in all three of [[Fate/stay night]]'s routes, she is the primary heroine of the Unlimited Blade Works route.\r\n\r\nRin has [[blue eyes]] and [[long hair|long]] [[black hair]] tied in a [[two side up]] hairdo. She often wears a red [[sweater]] with a white cross on the front, a [[pleated skirt|pleated]] [[black skirt]] and [[black thighhighs]]. \r\n\r\nShe is a poster child for [[zettai ryouiki]] and the [[tsundere]] archetype.\r\n\r\nh4. Appearance\r\n\r\n* !post #2097118: [[Fate/stay night]]\r\n* !post #8287175: [[Tohsaka Rin (Unlimited Blade Works)|Unlimited Blade Works]]\r\n* !post #1202056: [[Tohsaka Rin (Heaven's Feel)|Heaven's Feel]]\r\n* !post #4391116: [[The Adventures of Lord El-Melloi II]]\r\n* !post #5352109: [[Tohsaka Rin (Fate/Zero)|Fate/Zero]]\r\n* !post #11430884: [[Tohsaka Rin (Honkai: Star Rail)|Honkai: Star Rail]]\r\n* !post #1723747: [[Tohsaka Rin (Capsule Servant)|Capsule Servant]]\r\n\r\nh6. Costumes\r\n\r\n* !post #2089541: [[Kaleido Ruby]]\r\n* !post #4021816: [[tohsaka rin (type-moon racing)|TYPE-MOON Racing]]\r\n* !post #2116331: [[Tohsaka Rin (Formalcraft)|Formalcraft]]\r\n* !post #4474653: [[tohsaka rin (moony jewel)|Moony Jewel]]\r\n* !post #2271209: [[tohsaka rin (street choco-maid)|Street Choco-maid]]\r\n* !post #5539979: [[Tohsaka Rin (average one)|Average One]]\r\n* !post #2913576: [[Tohsaka Rin (kitchen patissiere)|Kitchen Patissiere]]\r\n* !post #8421148: [[tohsaka rin (march of the saints)|March of the Saints]]\r\n\r\nh6. Unnamed official costumes\r\n\r\n* !post #14496: [[Fate/Hollow Ataraxia]]\r\n* !post #843371: [[Fate/Hollow Ataraxia]]\r\n* !post #2168827: [[Fate/Hollow Ataraxia]]\r\n* 